flowchart LR
  B[Brief / Source Video] --> MODE{Execution Mode}

  MODE -->|GENERATE| SEM[Semantic Behavior Compiler]
  SEM --> MS[Motion System Lock]
  MS --> SC[Scene Contracts]
  SC --> GCR[Grammar Critic]
  GCR --> CMP[Remotion / Framer Compiler]

  MODE -->|ANALYZE| ING[FFprobe Ingest]
  ING --> SH[Shot Segmenter]
  SH --> KF[Keyframe Planner]
  KF --> VIS[Color / Layout Signals]
  KF --> MOT[Trajectory / Flow Signals]
  B --> AUD[Audio Events / Transcript]
  VIS --> FP[Feature Pack]
  MOT --> FP
  AUD --> FP
  FP --> NORM[Evidence-bound Normalizer]
  NORM --> MSJ[MotionStyle2JSON]
  MSJ --> CMP
  MSJ --> STORE[SQLite Style Signature Store]
  STORE --> RET[Similarity Retrieval]
  RET --> MS

  MODE -->|RECONSTRUCT_EXACT| FE[Frame Evidence]
  FE --> TRACK[Persistent IDs / Absolute State]
  TRACK --> TL[Per-frame / Dense / Hybrid Timeline]
  TL --> SVG[SVG + JS Player]
  SVG --> FID[Frame Fidelity Gate]

  CMP --> RENDER[Renderer Runtime]
  RENDER --> Q[Multi-vertical Gauntlet]
  FID --> Q
  GCR --> Q
  FP --> Q

  Q -->|PROMOTE| SUCCESS[Success Memory]
  Q -->|HOLD| FAIL[Failure / Gap Memory]
  SUCCESS --> PLAN[Living Plans]
  FAIL --> PLAN
  PLAN --> GRAPH[Graph Delta]
  GRAPH --> TASKS[Task Delta]
  TASKS --> SEM
  TASKS --> ING
  TASKS --> FE

  subgraph VerticalGates[Gauntlet Vertical Gates]
    V1[Extraction]
    V2[Evidence]
    V3[Normalization]
    V4[Compiler]
    V5[Reconstruction]
    V6[Grammar]
    V7[Creative]
    V8[Operations]
  end
  Q --> V1
  Q --> V2
  Q --> V3
  Q --> V4
  Q --> V5
  Q --> V6
  Q --> V7
  Q --> V8
